@startuml
title uc — Three-button CAN bench
left to right direction
actor Operator
rectangle "ESP32-C3 button-test firmware" {
  usecase "UC1 Run a selected reception test" as Run
  usecase "UC2 Inspect or cancel a test" as Inspect
}
Operator --> Run : blue / red / white
Operator --> Inspect : optional USB
note bottom of Run
Isolated bench only, never a charger.
Blue: reference 125 kbit/s.
Red: reference 250 kbit/s.
White: variable contents at 125 kbit/s.
end note
@enduml
